# Backend origin — the root, WITHOUT a trailing /api.
#
# Leave this unset — in dev (Vite proxy in vite.config.js) AND on Vercel
# (vercel.json rewrites /api and /admin to the backend). Auth depends on it:
# the refresh token is an httpOnly SameSite=Strict cookie the backend sets on
# /api/auth/, which the browser only sends when /api is same-origin.
#
# Only set it for a build served with neither (e.g. `npm run preview`); login
# still works there but sessions won't survive a reload. The backend must then
# list that frontend origin in its CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://spiritwise-backend.fly.dev
